# Place your Discord User Authorization Token below and rename this file to .token
# To obtain your token:
# 1. Open Discord in your browser (or press Ctrl+Shift+I in the Discord Desktop client)
# 2. Go to Network tab, filter by "/api"
# 3. Trigger any action, inspect request headers, copy the value of "Authorization"
# 4. Paste the 70-character token on a single line in this file (without quotes or prefixes)
